#: ../../../hwmon/honor-fmi.rst:13 ../../../hwmon/honor-fmi.rst:28
msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../hwmon/honor-fmi.rst:15
msgid ""
"The driver provides read-only monitoring of the fan speed on the HONOR FMI-"
"XX. The system firmware implements a ``GFNS`` ACPI method which returns the "
"speed of one of two firmware fan channels in RPM. Embedded Controller access "
"and serialization are handled by the firmware method."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../hwmon/honor-fmi.rst:20
msgid ""
"The driver does not expose fan control or direct Embedded Controller access."
msgstr ""

